      "content": "It is understandable that you are exhausted from the effort of trying to appear okay to others; that self-performance is incredibly draining. Wanting the pain to stop when you are in constant suffering is a natural human response, not inherently wrong. However, there are different ways to address that deep pain besides stopping your entire fight. Sometimes the goal shifts from \"fixing\" everything to simply surviving the immediate moment with support.",
